# .NET
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
# NOTE: `artifacts/` was ignored here for the .NET SDK's artifacts output layout, but this repo
# does not use it (no Directory.Build.props, no UseArtifactsOutput) and the rule was instead
# silently swallowing design evidence. Un-ignored 2026-07-28. If the SDK artifacts layout is ever
# enabled, ignore its specific output path rather than reinstating this.
*.user
.vs/
.idea/
*.DotSettings

# Unity (Phase 2 — unity/SBR project; ignores scoped so engine/sim/console .csproj stay tracked)
unity/SBR/[Ll]ibrary/
unity/SBR/[Tt]emp/
unity/SBR/[Oo]bj/
unity/SBR/[Bb]uild/
unity/SBR/[Bb]uilds/
unity/SBR/[Ll]ogs/
unity/SBR/[Uu]serSettings/
unity/SBR/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
unity/SBR/*.csproj
unity/SBR/*.sln
unity/SBR/*.slnx
*.csproj.meta

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
unity/SBR/[Dd]ata/

# Local run evidence — Unity batch test results, editor logs, scratch capture runs.
# Kept on disk for inspection, never committed and never sent upward (studio rule).
# Unity writes -testResults/-logFile wherever it is pointed; keep that out of the
# project root so a stray run cannot be mistaken for a tracked artifact.
evidence/
/Logs/

# Design-evidence frame sets stay on disk, never in history (frame-sets-stay-untracked, 2026-08-16; made repo-wide 2026-08-20 - per-directory ignores silently defaulted new docks to committable). Already-tracked legacy PNGs are unaffected.
docs/design/dd-import/**/*.png
docs/design/register-export.json
